Z||000000||Gokart||12-11-1999||08:28 PM||||I saw 7 Fieros today while x-mas shopping for my wife! That's a record for me! (not that I'm some kind of sicko that COUNTS FIEROS!) The last one I saw had a rear light mod. He apparently removed the tail light covers and painted them black from the inside, cut out four circles on each side, then fit in four circle lights a little smaller than ones you would see on a Camero. It didn't look too bad! Not bad at all! Figures the day I see this many Fieros, and the owner wasn't around, I didn't have any forum cards with me. Normally it would take me at least 2 months to see 7 different Fieros!||||reg||3
