Z||000011||Sage||12-12-1999||06:43 PM||||Have to go with Patrick on this.  Especially the fastback GT.  I think it is one of the neatest, most unique taillight treatments ever designed.  Why try to make it look like a Vette or anything else?  If you want vette taillights....buy a vette!  Just venting.   We all want something "a little different" now and then don't we?  But the Fiero has such nice lines and general design that you have to be careful what you change to keep it tasteful.  The round lights do look pretty good, but personally, I like the GT lights!||||reg||1
